# Random screen: the power-on reset UDE9's output RES_N is stuck low: the 6502, the PIAs and the VIA are held in reset forever. The video runs on its own and shows the video RAM's random power-on contents.
machine bw2001
title "Random screen"
brief "The BW-2001's screen fills with random characters at power-on and stays that way."
fault stuck UDE9.RST_N 0
